OL,3,GNEWSALewes adopts charter recognising
OL,4,Arights of trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "We wanted to create a
OL,7,Fresource that all councils and
OL,8,Fcommunities can use. It strikes a chord
OL,9,F- people really care about trees."
